/-! Reusable deployed-slice ⇒ `permSpec4` link for width-5 Poseidon classes.

The deployed flat slice reconstructs every live S-box output as
`Poseidon4Bridge.p17 (LC)`. These round equations turn each `fr5`/`pr5` into a
flat MDS-of-wires vector, so deployed evaluators can compose up to `permSpec4`
round-by-round without expanding long partial-round linear lanes. -/

namespace Shieldd.GnarkFormal.Deployed.Poseidon4Link

open scoped Shieldd.GnarkFormal.ChoiceFreeZMod
open Shieldd.GnarkFormal.Poseidon4Bridge
open Shieldd.GnarkFormal.Extracted.PoseidonHash4 (F Order)

variable [Fact (Nat.Prime Order)]

/-- Linear MDS row over five wires. -/
def row5 (m0 m1 m2 m3 m4 w0 w1 w2 w3 w4 : F) : F :=
  m0*w0 + m1*w1 + m2*w2 + m3*w3 + m4*w4

